<title>UK: Chugoku Electric sets 300 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Chugoku Electric sets 300 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and LTCB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHUGOKU ELECTRIC POWER CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.625 PCT MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.02    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.57     SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.95	LIST	  0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT SEPT 2003 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
